 not allowed while simulation is running.\00PxScene::addActors(): Actor already assigned to a scene. Call will be ignored!\00PxScene::addActors(): actor is in a pruning structure and cannot be added to a scene directly, use addActors(const PxPruningStructure& )\00PxScene::addRigidActors(): articulation link not permitted\00PxScene::removeActors(): Actor\00PxScene::removeActor(): Individual articulation links can not be removed from the scene\00PxScene::removeActor(): Actor\00PxScene::addArticulation(): Only Reduced coordinate articulations are currently supported when PxSceneFlag::eENABLE_GPU_DYNAMICS is set!\00PxScene::addArticulation(): this call is not allowed while the simulation is running. Call will be ignored!\00PxScene::addArticulation(): Articulation already assigned to a scene. Call will be ignored!\00PxScene::addArticulation(): The application need to set joint type. defaulting joint type to eFix\00PxScene::addArticulation(): The application need to set joint motion. defaulting joint type to eFix\00PxScene::removeArticulation(): Articulation\00PxBVHStructure connector could not have been removed!\00PxScene::addAggregate(): Aggregate already assigned to a scene. Call will be ignored!\00PxScene::removeAggregate(): Aggregate\00PxScene::getRenderBuffer() not allowed while simulation is running.\00PxScene::getSimulationStatistics() not allowed while simulation is running. Call will be ignored.\00PxScene::addBroadPhaseRegion(): region bounds are empty. Call will be ignored.\00PxScene::resetFiltering(): only PxRigidActor supports this operation!\00PxScene::simulate: Simulation is still processing last simulate call, you should call fetchResults()!\00PxScene::advance: advance() called illegally! advance() needed to be called after fetchCollision() and before fetchResult()!!\00PxScene::collide: collide() called illegally! If it isn't the first frame, collide() needed to be called between fetchResults() and fetchCollision(). Otherwise, collide() needed to be called before fetchCollision()\00At least one object is out of the broadphase bounds. To manage those objects, define a PxBroadPhaseCallback for each used client.\00PxScene::fetchCollision: fetchCollision() should be called after collide() and before advance()!\00PxScene::fetchResults: fetchResults() called illegally! It must be called after advance() or simulate()\00PXScene::fetchResultsStart: fetchResultsStart() called illegally! It must be called after advance() or simulate()\00PxScene::flushSimulation(): This call is not allowed while the simulation is running. Call will be ignored\00setVisualizationParameter: parameter out of range.\00setVisualizationParameter: value must be larger or equal to 0.\00getVisualizationParameter: param is not an enum.\00PxScene::unlockRead() called without matching call to PxScene::lockRead(), behaviour will be undefined.\00PxScene::lockWrite() detected after a PxScene::lockRead(), lock upgrading is not supported, behaviour will be undefined.\00PxScene::unlockWrite() called without matching call to PxScene::lockWrite(), behaviour will be undefined.\00PxScene::shiftOrigin() not allowed while simulation is running. Call will be ignored.\00PxScene::fetchSceneQueries was not called!\00PxScene::fetchQueries: fetchQueries() called illegally! It must be called after sceneQueriesUpdate()\00./physx/source/physx/src/NpSceneQueries.cpp\00 Precise sweep doesn't support MTD. Perform MTD with default sweep\00 eMTD cannot be used in conjunction with eASSUME_NO_INITIAL_OVERLAP. eASSUME_NO_INITIAL_OVERLAP will be ignored\00 Precise sweep doesn't support inflation, inflation will be overwritten to be zero\00./physx/source/physx/src/NpShapeManager.cpp")
